{"3586390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pilgrim Alliance", "steam_appid": 3586390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the leader, you must lead your team to survive this bizarre and perilous journey to India (Tianzhu)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Squad Combat: No more solo fights! Deploy multiple heroes to unleash screen-clearing ultimates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Recruit Bosses: Defeating a Boss gives you a chance to recruit them into your battle formation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Infinite Builds: 100s of spells and wacky items! Build various playstyles such as &quot;Full-screen CC&quot; or &quot;Burst DPS&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Fast-paced: Intense action with enemy waves lasting only 30-90 seconds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Vibrant Characters: Not just puppets, but &quot;people&quot; with unique stories and souls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Iconic Scenery: Experience the exotic journey to India, visiting sites like Lion Camel Ridge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the leader, you must lead your team to survive this bizarre and perilous journey to India (Tianzhu)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Squad Combat: No more solo fights! Deploy multiple heroes to unleash screen-clearing ultimates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Recruit Bosses: Defeating a Boss gives you a chance to recruit them into your battle formation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Infinite Builds: 100s of spells and wacky items! Build various playstyles such as &quot;Full-screen CC&quot; or &quot;Burst DPS&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Fast-paced: Intense action with enemy waves lasting only 30-90 seconds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Vibrant Characters: Not just puppets, but &quot;people&quot; with unique stories and souls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Iconic Scenery: Experience the exotic journey to India, visiting sites like Lion Camel Ridge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "PILGRIM ALLIANCE is a &quot;Journey to the West&quot; survivor rogue-lite. Lead your team through the &quot;81 Tribulations&quot; to reach India. Defeat and recruit Demon Kings to your squad! Mix teammates to create diverse builds, break through enemy swarms to defeat bosses, and craft your own legendary pilgrimage.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586390/dc0b0f6309b9dd303e55aa01e0dd3203f2cf5a61/header.jpg?t=1775311008", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586390/a4bd24cdd968e79cd79b6d40d57c0810480a96b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775311008", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586390/a4bd24cdd968e79cd79b6d40d57c0810480a96b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775311008", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<stron